# Recorded-video test view

Status: DONE
Milestone: Explicit recording-driven synthetic test controls
Dependencies: 05_STUDIO_AND_LAUNCH.todo, 20_CORE_MOTION_UPGRADE.todo

## Purpose
Let the supplied recording drive the synthetic test view through an obvious studio action,
without confusing recorded input with scripted demo motion or reopening a live camera.

## Tasks
- [x] Add Test from video and Replay last video controls using existing file playback.
- [x] Keep the selected file only in session memory; do not hard-code private paths.
- [x] Preserve the selected avatar; switch imported bind/clip previews to tracking mode.
- [x] Label the studio, synthetic stage, head detail and clean output as video replay.
- [x] Keep raw preview opt-in and protect active source/worker shutdown.
- [x] Exercise the new action with the supplied recording and both avatar paths.
- [x] Finish focused regressions, documentation, evidence and context handoff.

## Acceptance criteria
- [x] Recording input produces actual detections; it does not drive the scripted demo.
- [x] Cancelling selection or choosing a missing/non-file source is safe and explicit.
- [x] EOF or Disconnect enables replay with a new worker; active sources are not interrupted.
- [x] Raw camera/video pixels never enter synthetic or clean-output frames.
- [x] The input file is unchanged; no live camera, raw-frame or landmark export is performed.

## Completion evidence
- Final focused pass:53tests across video controls, rendering, imported animation and CLI/runtime.
  This is not a full-suite rerun; the preceding199-case core-motion receipt is archived separately.
- Fourteen native studio groups cover selection, labelled replay, EOF and replay-worker replacement.
- Supplied recording:478x850,125inferred frames in a bounded native check; both built-in and
  technical GLB views, clean output and black diagnostics executed, with raw preview off.
- Source unchanged and worker shutdown complete. This is a UI/source-route check, not another
  full-motion accuracy qualification or owner visual approval.
- Private report: .local\video-test-view\selected-recording-report.json.
- Guides, native previews and handbook source updated. Source-private aggregate receipt:
  docs\evidence\recorded-video-view-validation.json.

